===Etymology===
From {{inh|tr|ota|كدی|tr=kedi}}, from {{der|tr|gkm|γατί|t=kitten}}, ultimately from {{der|tr|la|cattus}}. It is related to {{cog|en|cat}}. Replaced native {{m|tr|pisi}}, which is now often child-speak, archaism, or vocative interjection.

